# The property-testing library (docs/plans/quickcheck.md, M4 to M6), one file
# per line, in load order, in the form of lib/basis/MANIFEST. It is written
# on lib/random:
# library: random
#
# The host column is yes for a file that every compiler of
# tests/lib/run-hosts.sh builds, and no for one that names a structure the
# Basis leaves optional (Int8, WideChar, SML90, IntArray2) or Rune's own
# (INet6Sock).
